🔄 Flow Breakdown
1️⃣ Basket API
You call checkout
Publishes → BasketCheckoutEvent
2️⃣ Ordering API
Consumes BasketCheckoutEvent
Creates order ✅
Publishes → OrderCreatedEvent
3️⃣ Payment API
Consumes OrderCreatedEvent
Publishes:
PaymentCompletedEvent OR
PaymentFailedEvent
4️⃣ Ordering API (again)
Consumes payment event
Updates status

--------------

No Order Created
→ No OutboxMessage inserted
→ Dispatcher finds 0 pending messages
→ OrderCreatedEvent NOT published
→ Payment consumer NOT triggered
